Optional fresh occlusion results:
gpu/games/bloodborne/occlusion_fresh.cpp adapts the CPU-side clear from
droogie/bbhost commit bcdd8ff0eeffdcf9df1955dc9b143d620a628fb3,
src/decomp/gx/query_token.cpp (GPL-3.0-or-later). Cachyborne observes the
