The Hunter's Dream large UDP datagrams:
gpu/bbnet20/thd/thd_net.cpp and tests/test_thd_datagrams.cpp adapt
droogie/bbhost commit bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb,
src/hle/net.cpp and tests/net_p2p_test.cpp (GPL-3.0-or-later).
