Offline Altar of Despair talk-script preparation:
gpu/games/bloodborne/{esd,rebirth_script}.{h,cpp} and
gpu/common/sha256.{h,cpp} adapt droogie/bbhost revision
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb (GPL-3.0-or-later),
src/engine/{esd,rebirth_script}.{h,cpp} and src/core/sha256.{h,cpp}.
Cachyborne adds bounded offsets/work, malformed-file and local-corpus tests,
and preserves conditions referenced only by unreferenced pointer lists.
The offline helper does not enable the unfinished runtime altar transaction.

gpu/games/bloodborne/rebirth_plan.h adapts the origin/refund calculation from
BBHOST engine/rebirth.cpp at the same revision. Cachyborne bounds values,
checks the echo cap before writes, and preserves the retail price operation
and rounding order. tests/test_rebirth_price.cpp adapts the retail price
threshold oracle from BBHOST tests/decomp/player_data_test.cpp.

Bounded archive and altar message generation:
scripts/bnd4.py, scripts/fmg.py and scripts/rebirth_assets.py adapt BBHOST
src/gcn/container.cpp and src/engine/menu_assets.cpp at
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb (GPL-3.0-or-later). Cachyborne
shares its BND4 reader with named parameter mods, preserves absolute payload
alignment, adds bounded format validation and publishes whole generated
layers without modifying source dumps. New altar messages include Spanish.

Runtime Altar of Despair rebirth:
gpu/games/bloodborne/rebirth.cpp, rebirth_session.h and player_data.{h,cpp}
adapt BBHOST engine/rebirth.cpp and engine/player_data.cpp at
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb (GPL-3.0-or-later).
Cachyborne uses its retail observer/menu infrastructure, validates writes
before applying a build, restores via the retail stat function, heals after
vitality changes, and tracks menu timeouts in elapsed time. Shared event
entry points in event_flags.cpp also replace duplicate kit-restoration calls.

Water interaction and effects schedule:
gpu/games/bloodborne/{water_gate.cpp,water_gate_model.h,sfx_schedule.h} and
tests/test_{water_gate_model,sfx_schedule}.cpp adapt droogie/bbhost
