Native scalar guest-call bridge:
gpu/shim/bbport_guest_call.{h,cpp} adapts the register-frame layout and
hle_call_guest_regs assembly from BBHOST src/core/thunk.{h,cpp} at
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb, GPL-3.0-or-later.
The native runtime retains host FS and uses GS for guest TLS; this bridge
therefore omits BBHOST's FS switching.


Plugin module ABI and lifecycle:
gpu/shim/plugins/bbhost_plugin.h preserves BBHOST's public C API at
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb (GPL-3.0-or-later).
The native module loader uses that ABI with owner-scoped callback retirement;
it does not yet provide the complete host service table or auto-load plugins.

Native version-1 host service prefix:
gpu/shim/bbport_plugin_host.{h,cpp} adapts the first twelve public services
described by BBHOST src/host/plugins.cpp at
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb (GPL-3.0-or-later).
It reuses native owner retirement, image identity, import and hook primitives;
image publication and API-call draining belong to the native implementation.
Live image writes share the native patch writer, preserve page permissions,
and require writable, non-executable ELF data and mappings. Code changes are
restricted to quiescent image phases. Normal-launch plugin discovery, remaining
API services and configuration ingestion are not yet integrated.


Owned hook ABI adapter:
gpu/shim/bbport_plugin_hooks.{h,cpp} implements BBHOST's BbHookFrame/BbHookCtx
contracts described by src/host/plugins.cpp at
bdc5cdf8be5f37188da9c2368e92be444fdc04cb, GPL-3.0-or-later.
It reuses Cachyborne's conditional native hook generator and adds shared
owner admission/drain rather than BBHOST's unowned global callback lists.
